                                "sense_id": "60b3f1f7-5649-38ef-8d3c-fdc802c6c6ac",
                                "text": "Near the entrance is a candyman who makes butterflies, birds and fish from melted sugar."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7c294018-1297-30ea-af2d-3d8c4a256bcf",
                        "entry_id": "d2c23582-3c1a-3b86-b04a-17dfb5960c0c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A male drug dealer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b94557db-d380-4df6-a4ab-f64008ecfbbd",
                                "sense_id": "7c294018-1297-30ea-af2d-3d8c4a256bcf",
                                "text": "He was on the payroll as Marvin Movie Star's candyman, his drug connection."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8b73e33-519a-44d4-8f52-203386cb5590",
                                "sense_id": "7c294018-1297-30ea-af2d-3d8c4a256bcf",
                                "text": "This bloke looked just like a candyman with his expensive togs and the glitter of a gold watch in the lights from the car park."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
